2186428001 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428001 1083 #uuid "bbcb8ff0-bcc8-5c73-8990-398286767616" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428002 1080 "2\\pi " 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428002 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428002 1083 #uuid "ea5fd737-b612-553b-8e19-91de7f399fb5" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428003 1080 "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{6}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)+C" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428003 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428003 1083 #uuid "ff2fa96a-ca7c-53d2-b91f-002c52d75021" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428004 1075 #edb/ref 17592186427995 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428004 1075 #edb/ref 17592186427996 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428004 1075 #edb/ref 17592186427997 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428004 1075 #edb/ref 17592186428001 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428004 1075 #edb/ref 17592186428003 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428004 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428004 1077 "selection" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428004 1078 #edb/ref 17592186427995 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428004 1079 #uuid "a430fc00-ecdb-5355-9c79-98aa358084c4" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428005 1075 #edb/ref 17592186427993 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428005 1075 #edb/ref 17592186427998 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428005 1075 #edb/ref 17592186427999 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428005 1075 #edb/ref 17592186428000 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428005 1075 #edb/ref 17592186428002 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428005 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428005 1077 "selection" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428005 1078 #edb/ref 17592186427993 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428005 1079 #uuid "ae824470-993a-5443-bdc9-a07993674d20" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428006 1068 #edb/ref 17592186428004 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428006 1069 "q-114039" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428006 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428006 1071 "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{1+6{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428006 1072 #uuid "276f25e8-0fe6-5cab-8eeb-f55147c6c339" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428006 1074 "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $6{x}^{2}=(\\sqrt{6}x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{6}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{6}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{1+6{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\sqrt{6}x)^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{6}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{6}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{6}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428007 1068 #edb/ref 17592186428005 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428007 1069 "q-114075" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428007 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428007 1071 "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{3/2}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428007 1072 #uuid "bacbcea3-6ad6-5840-9bf7-1e8371e0974d" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true] [17592186428007 1074 "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3/2}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =3{\\int }_{0}^{3/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/9)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{3/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/9}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/3)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{3})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{3}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=3\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nBefore substituting, we use the table below to change the limits from $x$ to $u.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\frac{3}{2}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can now write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3/2}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{3/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/3)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot (3\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u{|}_{0}^{1/2} \\\\  & =3(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =3(\\frac{\\pi }{6}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534618 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-15391250-e023-5a04-9057-9658fe4de707" 17592186427993 "answer-35bc1324-3515-5f3b-b9da-7c903cdfb324" 17592186427994 "answer-3b31a011-34d6-54fb-97d3-f5fd61f6b537" 17592186427995 "answer-68c27e18-cd86-5136-97ff-930ab97daa47" 17592186427996 "answer-74bba607-5459-5096-9775-251242509188" 17592186427997 "